WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000
At first light, in the quiet of the desert,

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
every Oud & Ember perfume begins with a single ingredient, chosen by hand.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Blended slowly, rested for weeks, and sealed with care.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Oud & Ember. Perfume, slow-crafted in the Emirates.
